PaymentRailsFactory_Create
├── when caller is neither the factory owner nor an approved operator
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRailsFactory_NotOwnerOrOperator
├── when caller is an approved operator
│   └── it should create and register the instance and emit PaymentRailsCreated
├── when caller is a revoked operator
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRailsFactory_NotOwnerOrOperator
├── when caller is the owner and not an operator
│   └── it should still create the instance
├── when owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRailsFactory_ZeroOwner
└── when owner is valid address
    ├── it should deploy a new PaymentRails contract
    ├── it should set the owner on the deployed PaymentRails
    ├── it should register the instance in the factory
    ├── it should increment the instance count
    ├── it should emit a PaymentRailsCreated event
    └── when called multiple times
        ├── it should deploy distinct instances
        └── it should register all instances
